"author": {"steamid": "76561199269193150", "personaname": "busyzekrom9000", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199269193150/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 7631, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 790, "last_played": 1789442694, "avatar": "848c55f8b0994a35cc35fdd1d59fbd6b59974043"}, "language": "english", "review": "Pretty good game for $10USD, nice difficulty, good enemy modifiers. I'd recommend a few things: A sandbox mode would be nice, kinda like a stress test. Some more biomes would be nice, Forest with more insectoid enemies, and maybe even a monkey based boss at the end, etc. More weapons, maybe a Sun Staff where it fires an orb that can be charged for a bigger range at the price of slower projectile speed and more ammo consumption. Crab mutations, during the run your crab has a chance to find a mutation portal, where on clear, you're able to mutate the crab into a different type, with different playstyles and everything. looking forward to the game when it's done with the beta", "timestamp_created": 1741328308, "timestamp_updated": 1741328308, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "189566651", "author": {"steamid": "76561198445002394", "personaname": "Hyperpatriot", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198445002394/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 8371, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3183, "last_played": 1786848417, "avatar": "632386a8183159268700338d7d7c84c89dda9541"}, "language": "english", "review": "The GOAT of Crab-type games", "timestamp_created": 1741325218, "timestamp_updated": 17413252